{"id":"n31511-1-8","stage":4,"title":"걸터앉다 · 坐在边上","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n31511-1-8-1","ko":"다리가 아파서 못 서 있겠어요.","zh":"我的腿好痛，站都站不起来了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"다리가","meaning":"腿，下肢","explanation":"다리：腿，下肢；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"다리","audio":"/audio/982037b144c2b329e189.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62840","senseId":"1","lemma":"다리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아파서","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"서","meaning":"站，站立","explanation":"서다：站，站立；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"서다","audio":"/audio/4fccaaf883d3c239af91.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68756","senseId":"1","lemma":"서다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있겠어요.","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"982037b144c2b329","term":"다리","zh":"腿，下肢","audio":"/audio/982037b144c2b329e189.mp3","entryId":"62840","definition":"人或动物身体下的，做站、走、跳的动作的身体部位。","pronunciation":["다리"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"4fccaaf883d3c239","term":"서다","zh":"站，站立","audio":"/audio/4fccaaf883d3c239af91.mp3","entryId":"68756","definition":"人或动物把脚放在地上，使身体挺直。","pronunciation":["서다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/1e46fe55ee57175a70bb.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n31511-1-8-2","ko":"그럼 여기 계단에라도 걸터앉아 있어.","zh":"那你就坐在这里的台阶上吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"계단에라도","meaning":"阶梯，楼梯","explanation":"계단：阶梯，楼梯；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"계단","audio":"/audio/cbd5d64a59da9222d592.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23937","senseId":"1","lemma":"계단","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걸터앉아","meaning":"坐在边上，坐在沿上","explanation":"걸터앉다：坐在边上，坐在沿上；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"걸터앉다","audio":"/audio/980b8cdc65e89cf03c8e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31511","senseId":"1","lemma":"걸터앉다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어.","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"cbd5d64a59da9222","term":"계단","zh":"阶梯，楼梯","audio":"/audio/cbd5d64a59da9222d592.mp3","entryId":"23937","definition":"为了上下走动而按顺序把小台阶倾斜连接起来的设施。","pronunciation":["계단","게단"]},{"id":"980b8cdc65e89cf0","term":"걸터앉다","zh":"坐在边上，坐在沿上","audio":"/audio/980b8cdc65e89cf03c8e.mp3","entryId":"31511","definition":"用臀部的一部分坐在某物上。","pronunciation":["걸ː터안따"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/8251504b29d1686363fa.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.676,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=31511","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":132,"sequenceScore":2.5027,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我的腿好痛，站都站不起来了。","那你就坐在这里的台阶上吧。","您完全同意那个人的观点吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我的腿好痛，站都站不起来了。","那你就坐在这里的台阶上吧。","您完全同意那个人的观点吗？"],"answer":1}]}
